  "insights.lifeRebuilt.metaDescription": { en: "After losing his business, falling into debt and facing serious illness, Tariq Saddique rebuilt his inner world through meditation and the Master Key System. Discover the story behind Unleash Your Power.", es: "After losing his business, falling into debt and facing serious illness, Tariq Saddique rebuilt his inner world through meditation and the Master Key System. Discover the story behind Unleash Your Power." },
